OL,3,GNEWSA'Cracker of a comedian' - Frank
OL,4,ACarson commemorated on his centenary
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking ahead of the unveiling, his
OL,7,Fson Tony Carson said: "It's a great
OL,8,Fhonour, a privilege, and something for
OL,9,Fus all to cherish."
